# W17 (2026-09-30 ~03:05): image glm53-tensorfold:b9 = b7's patch list + 0550 (memory safety) + 0560 (multi-slot
# prefill); GLM53_TF_MULTI_PREFILL=1 adopted (a round's prefill pieces in one forward); 0550 built in but OFF
# (GLM53_TF_ADMIT_MEM=free, GLM53_TF_SELECT_SCRATCH=off, GLM53_TF_ALLOC_TRIM_GB=0 = b7's behaviour) because with it on the
# first 24.5k / 98k prefill after a burst of short requests ran 1,454 / 1,550 tok/s (and 1,512 / 1,541 after the needle),
# never seen with it off (docs/RESULTS.md W17). Gates of this exact config (load M6, results/W17): exact 10/10 twice,
# batchexact 4/4 twice, W9 transcripts, reply sha 8794a3463259cc2f, 13/13 glmbench hashes == b7, N1 12/12, 92/92 grouped
# replies == cold alone (greedy / seed 7, thinking off / low, bursts of 8 x 200-4,000 tokens), prefill 1,603 / 1,612 and
# 1,610 / 1,610, C4 per-stream TTFT (RigMark shape, reasoning low) 0.82 s vs b7 1.64 s in the same sequence, thinking off
# 0.63 vs 0.92, C2 0.57 vs 0.69, MMLU-200 88.0%. Memory (same heavy sequence on b7 = load C7): 4 x 250k stress minimum
# 7.50 / 6.92 GiB (b7 7.47 / 7.41: worker -0.5 GiB, the group forwards' buffers); neither meets the old 8 GiB bar after
# this sequence (W15's lighter one gave b7 8.27 / 8.28).
# Revert to W15: IMAGE=glm53-tensorfold:b7 and drop the four W17 lines at the end (results/W17/prod.env.before-W17).
# Partial: GLM53_TF_MULTI_PREFILL=0 on b9 = b7 (+ 0550's page-cache drop of its own session-tier writes). 0550 on
# (the W17 B9 load, +1.1 GiB floor, needle dip 1.7 instead of 4 GiB): drop the three 0550 lines.
# W15 (2026-09-29 ~21:20): image glm53-tensorfold:b7 = b5's patch list (0001-0490) + 0500 (image input, with W14's MTP
# eager fix) + 0540 (replay snapshot at the last 64-grid point strictly before a prompt's end, GLM53_TF_SNAPSHOT_BEFORE_END,
# default on; a piece's first token emitted when the piece ends, GLM53_TF_EMIT_FIRST, default on) + GLM53_TF_VISION=1 with
# 64 / 64 MB row / prep caches (docs/VISION.md's stress sizing) + GLM53_TF_REASONING_FIELDS=reasoning (delta.reasoning /
# message.reasoning only, as the vLLM kit; clients that read only reasoning_content no longer see thinking).
# Gates (docs/RESULTS.md W15, load B7 = this file): exact 10/10 twice, batchexact 4/4 twice, W9 transcripts identical,
# reply sha 8794a3463259cc2f, 13/13 glmbench cell hashes == W12, N1 12/12 shas == W12 FIN / prod b4 (drafted == serial
# 6/6, batched == alone 6/6), prefill 24.5k / 98k 1,610 / 1,607 and 1,605 / 1,606 tok/s, grid-aligned 8K cold 1,565
# (b5 1,593: -1.8%, 0540's extra chunk), decode vs W12 FIN 1 stream -0.4% / 4 streams 80.6 (81.2), replay of identical
# 8K / 32K / 64K prompts cached n - 64 in 0.23 / 0.26 / 0.29 s (b5: 5.1 / 10.2 / 10.9 s), C4 first tokens staggered
# (thinking off: median 0.93 s vs 1.46 s with EMIT_FIRST=0), images ok (screenshot titles / display / clock, CER 0 at
# 12 px, counts, two-image comparison, URL == data:, refusals are 400s), MMLU-200 88.0%, refusals 0/10, 4 x 250k stress
# MemAvailable min 8.27 / 8.28 GiB (head carries the 1.13 GB tower; W12 9.74 / 8.32), needle 314k found; during that
# needle (after the stress + MMLU) MemAvailable fell to 6.39 / 6.42 GiB for ~35 s (W12: 8.27 / 6.58): a device-memory
# transient at the end of a lone ~300k prefill, see RESULTS W15.
# Revert to W12 (b5): IMAGE=glm53-tensorfold:b5, drop GLM53_TF_VISION, GLM53_TF_VISION_CACHE_MB, GLM53_TF_VISION_PREP_MB and
# GLM53_TF_REASONING_FIELDS (results/W15/prod.env.before-W15). Partial: vision off alone = drop GLM53_TF_VISION (text
# bit-identical, head gets the tower's ~1.1-1.9 GiB back); 0540 off on b7 = GLM53_TF_SNAPSHOT_BEFORE_END=0 and / or
# GLM53_TF_EMIT_FIRST=0; both reasoning fields again = GLM53_TF_REASONING_FIELDS=both.
# W12 (2026-09-29 ~17:15): image glm53-tensorfold:b5 (every patch through 0490; 0420 / 0430 / 0440 / 0450 / 0470 present
# but off; 0460 with its two W12 fixes; 0500 not included) + GLM53_TF_L2PF=1 / GLM53_TF_L2PF_MB=8 (0460: the next
# kernels' weights into L2 in every decode path, 8 MiB a site: 1 stream +2.4%, lone requests +2.8%, 4 streams +1.2%) and
# GLM53_TF_BATCH_CAPTURE_AFTER=8 (was 3: 4 streams +2.0%, lone requests in slots 1-3 unchanged; BATCH_GRAPHS=0 made them
# 3% slower). 0490 (API context limit, context_length_exceeded 400s, /tokenize, the pool-edge fix) is on by default.
# Gates (docs/RESULTS.md W12, load FIN): exact 10/10 twice, batchexact 4/4 twice, W9 transcripts identical, all 13
# glmbench cells' reply hashes == control, reply sha 8794a3463259cc2f, N1 long exactness (8.7k / 16.9k / 32.1k prompts:
# drafted == serial 6/6, batched == alone 6/6, == prod b4), decode vs the b5 control 1 stream +2.5% / 4 streams +2.8%,
# prefill 24.5k 1,602 / 1,604, 98k 1,579 / 1,612 tok/s, 4 x 250k stress MemAvailable min 9.74 / 8.32 GiB, no OOM kill,
# MMLU-200 88.0%, refusals 0/10, needle 314k found (1,347 tok/s cold; MemAvailable during it, after the stress and
# MMLU, 8.27 / 6.58 GiB: W10's same observation was 8.55 / 7.39, see RESULTS W12).
# Not adopted (knobs stay off): 0440 GLM53_TF_DEC_QMM (-3.9% 1 stream; E1 0.75x in the microbench, not loaded),
# 0450 GLM53_TF_GPU_ROUND (sample 0%, resident / 1 -2.3% 1 stream and +0.5 / +1.2% at 4, PEEK=0 -4%),
# GLM53_TF_BATCH_GRAPHS=0 (+1.9% 4 streams, lone requests in slots 1-3 -3%), L2PF 4 MiB (+0.8%) / site e, 0460's RoCE knobs.
# Revert to W10 / W11: IMAGE=glm53-tensorfold:b4, drop GLM53_TF_L2PF and GLM53_TF_L2PF_MB, set GLM53_TF_BATCH_CAPTURE_AFTER
# back to 3 (results/W12/prod.env.before-W12). b5 with those lines reverted == b4 (reply sha, exact, batchexact,
# transcripts, N1 and every glmbench hash equal), plus 0490's API fixes.
# W10 (2026-09-29 ~04:20): image glm53-tensorfold:b4 (every patch through 0410; 0390's tile table from the W10 GPU sweep,
# 0410's engine.py message fixed) + GLM53_TF_MLA_EXPAND=v2 (0390 retiled latent absorb / expand, same bits: prefill
# +7.1% / +6.7% at 24.5k / 98k, decode not lower), GLM53_TF_DECODE_OVERLAP=1 (0370: 1 stream +1.2-1.9%, 4 streams
# +1.0-1.3%, transcripts identical, cancels clean) and GLM53_TF_MAX_DRAFT_ROWS=16 (0380: edit / copy cells +16-27%, every
# other cell within +-2% with identical reply hashes). Gates (docs/RESULTS.md W10, load FIN): exact 10/10 twice, batchexact 4/4 twice,
# reply sha 8794a3463259cc2f, prefill 24.5k 1,602-1,614 / 98k 1,577-1,606 tok/s, decode 1 / 4 streams +1.1-3.7% / +2.4-3.1%,
# 4 x 250k stress MemAvailable min 10.49 / 9.36 GiB, no OOM, MMLU-200 88.0%, refusals 0/10, needle 314k found (1,376 tok/s;
# MemAvailable during it, after the stress and MMLU, 8.55 / 7.39 GiB: see RESULTS W10), edit cells 97-117 tok/s, cancel clean.
# Not adopted (knobs stay off): 0400 KDA v2 split +1.0% (fused slower), 0410 sparse v2 +0%, CPU_PIN=auto +0.4%,
# 8,192-row chunks (stress min 7.23 GiB on the worker node).
# Revert to W9: IMAGE=glm53-tensorfold:b2 and drop GLM53_TF_MLA_EXPAND, GLM53_TF_DECODE_OVERLAP, GLM53_TF_MAX_DRAFT_ROWS
# (each knob can also be dropped alone on b4: b4 with none of them == b2, PTX 33 / 33 and reply sha equal).
# Production: TensorFold GLM-5.3-Flash on 2x DGX Spark on :8000 (GLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3), 2026-09-28 ~11:00.
# W9 (2026-09-28 ~23:10): + GLM53_TF_COMM_BACKEND=roce (0230/0350 one-shot RoCE all-gather, 256 KiB max, both CX7
# functions: decode +7% 1 stream / +4% 4 streams, transcripts byte-identical), GLM53_TF_B12X=4 (0360 one-pass sparse latent
# attention in fast chunks: +6.3% / +6.7% prefill, same reply sha) and 4,096-row lone-request chunks (PREFILL_ROWS_MAX /
# SOLO_PIECE 4096, W8's documented memory step back: at 8,192 the 4 x 250k stress bottomed at 7.82-7.83 GiB on the worker node in W9
# with and without b12x). Gates (docs/RESULTS.md W9, load I): exact 10/10, batchexact 4/4, reply sha 8794a3463259cc2f, prefill
# 24.5k 1,497-1,500 / 98k 1,493-1,498 tok/s (+2-3% over W8), stress MemAvailable min 9.72 / 8.67 GiB, MMLU-200 88.0%, refusals 0/10.
# Revert to W8: drop GLM53_TF_COMM_BACKEND, GLM53_TF_ROCE_MARK, GLM53_TF_B12X; PREFILL_ROWS_MAX / SOLO_PIECE back to 8192
# (8192 only with memory to spare: see W9). NCCL only: GLM53_TF_COMM_BACKEND=nccl (or leave /cache/roce-failed in place).
# W8 (2026-09-28 ~19:15): image glm53-tensorfold:b2 (every patch through 0360; 0330's tc loader built for this GPU's
# arch only) with 0320 row-split prefill (GLM53_TF_PREFILL_PP=1), 8,192-row chunks for a request alone (0335
# GLM53_TF_SOLO_PIECE=8192 + PREFILL_ROWS_MAX=8192; batch pieces stay 2,048), 0310 shared-prefix marks
# (GLM53_TF_PREFIX_SHARE=1) and the 0300 request log. Gates (docs/RESULTS.md W8): reply sha 8794a3463259cc2f, exact 10/10,
# batchexact 4/4, prefill 24.5k 1,468-1,473 / 98k 1,447-1,451 tok/s (+16% over kvpool), decode unchanged, MMLU-200 88.0%,
# refusals 0/10, needle at 314k found (1,287 tok/s), 4 x 250k stress MemAvailable min 9.23 / 8.14 GiB (>= 8, thin on the worker node).
# 0330 tc not used (cfg 1/2 cannot launch on GB10; cfg 3 -4% end to end). Revert: IMAGE=glm53-tensorfold:kvpool and drop
# the five W8 knobs below (first step if memory is short: PREFILL_ROWS_MAX / SOLO_PIECE 4096, +0.8 instead of +2.3 GiB).
# W6 (2026-09-28 ~16:30): image glm53-tensorfold:kvpool (through 0290) with the shared KV pool: 4 slots share one
# 1,048,576-token pool (same 7.44 GiB a node as 4 x 262k), CONTEXT 1,048,576 a request. Gates: docs/RESULTS.md W6.
# Revert to 4 x 262k: IMAGE=glm53-tensorfold:sessdisk, CONTEXT=262144, drop GLM53_TF_KV_POOL_TOKENS.
# 4 concurrent requests x 262,144 tokens each (GLM53_TF_BATCH=4), FP8 latent KV (patches/0220), image
# glm53-tensorfold:sessdisk (every committed patch through 0260 at 74191b1: 0230 / 0240 / 0260 present but off; 0250's
# NVMe session tier on; W4 2026-09-28 ~13:50), built on both nodes. W1 image: glm53-tensorfold:mtpc (through 0220 with
# 0190's MTP prefill cache rows). Before W1: image glm53-tensorfold:fp8kv (commit c9ac4bd) without the two 0190 lines below.
# Start: CONFIG=config/prod.env scripts/serve.sh start  (the restore timer and the watchdog start from this file too)
# = config/prod-batch.env with GLM53_TF_SESSION_GIB=2 instead of 4: with the 4 GiB store the 4 x 250k stress run
# (results/K1/stress2) bottomed out at MemAvailable 7.3 GiB on the worker node (target >= 8). Measurements: docs/RESULTS.md,
# "4 x 256k batch production". Replaced the 524k single-stream config (SESSION_GIB=12), which died of unified-memory
# OOM at ~07:00 on 2026-09-28 while its session store filled.
# Fallback (single stream): git show 0aa3a91:config/prod.env, with GLM53_TF_SESSION_GIB lowered to 4-6.

# --- nodes / link ---------------------------------------------------------------
WORKER_SSH="<worker-ssh>"
HEAD_IP="<head-ip>"
NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME=enp1s0f1np1
NCCL_IB_HCA=rocep1s0f1
MASTER_PORT=29551

# --- weights ----------------------------------------------------------------------
HEAD_HF="<head HF cache>"
WORKER_HF=/root/.cache/huggingface
# patches/0140 prepared rank folders: <HF cache>/../glm53-tf/prepared on each node (written by the first start)
MODEL_PATH=/root/.cache/huggingface/hub/models--neko-legends--GLM-5.3-Flash-Uncensored-EXL3/snapshots/07135ec082f8f11f7a71e4244a4e5167a0f96277
DRAFTER=/root/.cache/huggingface/hub/models--incoai--GLM-5.3-Flash-DFlash2/snapshots/7d74cdd881ed7e32c31175984a67823127b66cfe

# --- serving (same model id and port as production) ---------------------------------
IMAGE=glm53-tensorfold:b9
SERVED_NAME=GLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3
HOST=127.0.0.1
PORT=8000
CONTEXT=1048576
MAX_TOKENS=32768

# --- ops (scripts/serve.sh) ---------------------------------------------------------
CANARY=warn
WARMUP_LENGTHS="4096 16384"
# the 4th slot needs MemFree (not MemAvailable): page cache counts against the load-time slot rule
MEM_GATE_GIB=108
MEM_GATE_TIMEOUT=300
MEM_GATE_DROP_CACHES=1

# --- engine -------------------------------------------------------------------------
GLM53_TF_NONEXPERT=q4mse
GLM53_TF_LATENT_KV=1
GLM53_TF_KV_DTYPE=fp8
GLM53_TF_PREFILL_ROWS=auto
# W8: 8,192-row fast chunks (lean buffers 3.10 GiB a rank, was 0.78); used by lone requests via SOLO_PIECE below
# W9: 4,096 (1.55 GiB a rank): with 8,192 the 4 x 250k stress minimum fell under 8 GiB on the worker node (7.82)
GLM53_TF_PREFILL_ROWS_MAX=4096
GLM53_TF_FAST_PREFILL=1
GLM53_TF_LEAN_PREFILL=1
GLM53_TF_LEAN_BLOCK=512
GLM53_TF_PREFILL_OVERLAP=1
# W8: patches/0320 row split: hc_post / hc_pre on each rank's half of every 512-row sub-block (same bits, +7-8% prefill)
GLM53_TF_PREFILL_PP=1
GLM53_TF_FAST_GATHER=bf16
GLM53_TF_FP8_PREFILL=0
# W5 (docs/RESULTS.md): fat stays; 0270 auto / fast2 are 2-5% slower end to end at 2,048-row chunks despite faster kernels
GLM53_TF_FAST_EXPERTS=fat
# patches/0190: parallel MoE grouping + in-place combine (same bits). W1 (docs/RESULTS.md): 32-query latent tiles
# in fast chunks (same bits, +5% prefill) and the MTP head's prefill rows as cache writes only (same bits, +5%);
# together +11% at 24.5k / 98k, decode and memory unchanged. mtp_window stays off (a no-op in batch pieces; zeroed
# head rows cost MTP acceptance in single-stream mode, Z2).
GLM53_TF_MOE_GLUE=5
GLM53_TF_ATTN_BM32=1
GLM53_TF_MTP_PREFILL_CACHE=1
GLM53_TF_EXPERT_LOOP=1
GLM53_TF_EXPERT_LOOP_CFG=4,2
GLM53_TF_CALIB=cached
GLM53_TF_CALIB_ONLINE=1
GLM53_TF_DEPTH=cost
GLM53_TF_LOOKUP=1
GLM53_TF_AUTO_FDRAFTS=7
GLM53_TF_PROFILE=0

# W9: patches/0230 + 0350: model all-gathers up to 256 KiB a rank over RoCE (both CX7 functions), control exchanges on
# NCCL; a run-time RoCE failure writes the marker and the next start of both ranks uses NCCL (delete it to retry)
GLM53_TF_COMM_BACKEND=roce
GLM53_TF_ROCE_MARK=/cache/roce-failed
# W9: patches/0360: b12x bit 4 = one-pass sparse latent attention in fast prefill chunks (FP8 KV; own snapshot tag)
GLM53_TF_B12X=4
# W10: patches/0390: latent absorb / expand v2 kernels (same bits as v1; 4-warp tiles from the W10 sweep)
GLM53_TF_MLA_EXPAND=v2
# W10: patches/0370: decode-round host work off the critical path (sync, emit, plan rider, 500 us GIL switch); both ranks
GLM53_TF_DECODE_OVERLAP=1
# W10: patches/0380: verify windows of up to 16 rows (drafts past the 8th only when confident; edit / copy streams)
GLM53_TF_MAX_DRAFT_ROWS=16
# W12: patches/0460: the next kernels' weights prefetched into L2 during decode's latency-bound windows (sites a, f, o),
# every decode path incl. the Batcher's; 8 MiB a site (4 MiB: +0.8% only); reads only, same bits
GLM53_TF_L2PF=1
GLM53_TF_L2PF_MB=8

# --- batching (0120 / 0200) ----------------------------------------------------------
GLM53_TF_BATCH=4
GLM53_TF_BATCH_PIECE=2048
# W8: patches/0335: a fast prompt alone in the batch prefills in 8,192-token pieces (+6% prefill; a newcomer waits up to
# one ~5.5 s piece); back to 2,048 at the next piece once another request is admitted
# W9: 4,096 (see PREFILL_ROWS_MAX)
GLM53_TF_SOLO_PIECE=4096
GLM53_TF_BATCH_RESERVE_GB=11
GLM53_TF_BATCH_ADMIT_GB=2
# W12: 8 (was 3): 4-slot graph keys rarely repeat and a capture costs a forward (W11); lone requests keep their graphs
GLM53_TF_BATCH_CAPTURE_AFTER=8
GLM53_TF_BATCH_PARITY_KEY=1
GLM53_TF_BATCH_MTP=1
GLM53_TF_BATCH_ROW_MS=6.5
GLM53_TF_BATCH_SHORT=1024

# --- sessions (0110, in batch slots with 0180) -----------------------------------------
GLM53_TF_BATCH_SESSIONS=1
GLM53_TF_SESSION_GIB=2
GLM53_TF_SESSION_RESERVE_GIB=6
# patches/0250: the store's NVMe tier at /sessions (W4 2026-09-28: 6 x 39k sessions on 4 slots + 2 GiB RAM resumed in
# 0.42-0.45 s with 38,912 cached, also after a restart; same reply hashes; exact 10/10; results/W4)
GLM53_TF_SESSION_DISK=/sessions
GLM53_TF_SESSION_DISK_GIB=64
# patches/0290 shared KV pool (W6): pages of 256 tokens; a request reserves prompt + max_tokens + 64 at admission,
# idle slots spill to the session store when short, else it waits
GLM53_TF_KV_POOL_TOKENS=1048576
# W8: patches/0310: a snapshot at the end of the system prompt (2k-131k tokens, <= 4 kept in RAM), admissions wait for
# a partner's mark (a 4-session burst over a 20k system prompt: 24.8 s wall instead of 72 s; resumed == fresh)
GLM53_TF_PREFIX_SHARE=1
# W8: patches/0300: one JSON line a request (no text; hashes only), rank 0; scripts/traffic-report.py reads it
GLM53_TF_REQUEST_LOG=/sessions/requests.jsonl

# Reasoning effort (patches/0150): default high for thinking requests that name none; honour OpenAI top-level
# reasoning_effort (none/minimal = thinking off, low, medium->high, high, max). 2026-09-28, user request.
GLM53_TF_DEFAULT_EFFORT=high
GLM53_TF_EFFORT_FIELD=1

# W15: patches/0500 image input (OpenAI image_url parts, data: and http(s) URLs fetched by rank 0; the BF16 tower on
# rank 0, 1.13 GB); row and preprocessed-image caches at 64 MB each (docs/VISION.md: stress sizing, saves 0.4 GB)
GLM53_TF_VISION=1
GLM53_TF_VISION_CACHE_MB=64
GLM53_TF_VISION_PREP_MB=64
# W15: reasoning in delta.reasoning / message.reasoning only (the vLLM kit's field; RigMark counted "both" twice)
GLM53_TF_REASONING_FIELDS=reasoning
# W17: patches/0560 multi-slot prefill on (C4 first tokens 1.64 -> 0.82 s); patches/0550 off (see the header)
GLM53_TF_MULTI_PREFILL=1
GLM53_TF_ADMIT_MEM=free
GLM53_TF_SELECT_SCRATCH=off
GLM53_TF_ALLOC_TRIM_GB=0
